title: "startup-cultural-data: Art & Cultural Places — LAU/EPCI + Overture Maps → Leaflet Map"
abstract: >
  Python pipelines and reproducible workflows to build an EU-wide cultural
  places dataset from official boundaries (Eurostat GISCO, Etalab) and
  Overture Maps, with Leaflet-based visualization.
